  "prefLabel": "Puc 302.06 Energy conservation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 302.06 “Energy conservation” means energy use activities that cost less to implement than the value of the resources saved.\n\nSource. #6605, eff 10-21-97 (from Puc 302.01); ss by #8448, eff 10-18-05; ss by #10603, eff 5-21-14 (from Puc 302.07); ss by #14106, eff 10-25-24, EXPIRES: 10-25-34 (formerly Puc 302.09) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Puc 300)",
